    ],
    "text": "Order under Section 02",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      382.69,
      539.93,
      417.76
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the President has by proclamation made under paragraph (3A) of Article 31 of the Constitution of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka and published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1889/31 of November 20th, 2014, declared hisintention of appealing to the people for a mandate to hold office, by election, for a further term.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      430.69,
      539.93,
      453.76
    ],
    "text": "And whereas the Commissioner of Elections is required, upon the making of a Proclamation under that paragraph,to take a poll for the Election of President.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      466.69,
      539.89,
      501.76
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, I, Mahinda Deshapriya, Commissioner of Elections, by virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 2 ofthe Presidential Elections Act, No. 15 of 1981 as amended by Presidential Elections (Amendment) Act, No. 16 of 1988, do bythis Order fix \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      96.09,
      506.29,
      436.37,
      517.36
    ],
    "text": "(i) December Eighth, 2014 as the date of nomination of candidates for such election ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      93.81,
      521.89,
      539.88,
      532.96
    ],
    "text": "(ii) Election Secretariat, Sarana Mawatha, Rajagiriya as the place of nomination of candidates for such election ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      107.85,
      533.89,
      122.85,
      544.96
    ],
    "text": "and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
